 corridors, master the shadows with advanced lighting and bloom, and survive the dark using immersive local proximity voice chat.\n\nWhether you're braving the facility alone or communicating with friends in real-time spatial audio, every sound matters, and danger is always close behind.\n\nKey Features:\n\nImmersive Proximity Voice Chat: Talk, whisper, or scream\u2014spatial audio ensures the entity (and other players) hear everything you do.\n\nAtmospheric Horror: Explore a haunting, finely-tuned environment packed with moody lighting, refraction effects, and suspense.\n\nDynamic Community Hub: Experience an interactive start menu that highlights community supporters directly in-game.\n\nSeasonal Updates: Regular content drops, starting with our massive Halloween event bringing unique cosmetics and eerie new environmental touches.", "short_description": "Dive into the dark in Primal Redux, a terrifying VR indie horror experience featuring immersive proximity voice chat and chilling atmospheres."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://primalreduxstudio.vercel.app/#legal", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Almond", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://primalreduxstudio.vercel.app/#", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1292821687256173"}}]}, "scheduled_offe